commit 7dcd73ffb5463cc2f6989301af90a97fbdd87f4d
Author: Nxeon <haxkodi@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Sep 19 04:22:11 2026 +0000

    Fix NxLabs StoreBrowser: function props can't cross the Client Component boundary

    Staging blew up with "Functions cannot be passed directly to Client
    Components" on every page using StoreBrowser — hrefFor/renderExtra were
    closures passed from a Server Component into this "use client" component,
    which React can't serialize across that boundary. Replaced with plain
    serializable props: `basePath` (the href is built as
    `${basePath}/${mod.gameFamily}/${mod.slug}`) and `serversByFamily` (a plain
    Record, portal-only, read internally to decide whether to render
    QuickAddButton or the "order one" prompt). Also fixed a related bug in
    RatingsAndComments where a star-only submit permanently hid the rating form.

    Confirmed via curl against staging after redeploy.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

